			<div class="content" id="post-content-3877100">
									

<p>A while ago, I read an article about how the US government was planning it's long-term radioactive waste dump sites. In particular, what caught my attention was the talk about how they planned to show that the materials are dangerous. Since the radioactive danger will outlast the English language, they have to do so in a way that doesn't use language, and as such they did everything they could to make the places as scary and filled with death iconography as possible.<br />
<strong>EDIT:</strong> The article I was thinking of is called <a href="https://www.damninteresting.com/this-place-is-not-a-place-of-honor/">This is not a place of honor.</a></p>
<p>I would like to thank <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drchandra" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1956625); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1956625&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533146208" alt="DrChandra" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1956625)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drchandra" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1956625); return false;">DrChandra</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peppersghost" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1553042); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1553042&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533146208" alt="PeppersGhost" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1553042)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peppersghost" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1553042); return false;">PeppersGhost</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/spikebrennan" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(908688); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=908688&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533146208" alt="spikebrennan" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=908688)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/spikebrennan" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(908688); return false;">spikebrennan</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyantreuse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2303803); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2303803&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533146208" alt="Cyantreuse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2303803)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikido