<p>The nuclear blood serpents are for <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cadavercommander" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3187823); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3187823&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533146208" alt="CadaverCommander" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3187823)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cadavercommander" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3187823); return false;">CadaverCommander</a></span></p>
<p>Hun, Ka'a and Óox are Yucatec Mayan for one, two and three. This is a language which still has fluent and native speakers. América, Barcelona and Cáceres are from the Spanish phonetic alphabet &#8212; it was NATO at one point, but I decided that Spanish made more sense.</p>
