														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3878250">
									

<p>I feel like the conversation at the end undersells the danger. Like, yeah, they're just nukes, and not even particularly powerful ones, but they're nukes that can't be disarmed and are probably pretty fragile.</p>
<p>The status quo seems stable enough, but messing with the set up at all strikes me as having a good chance of accidentally detonating them. Which may not be apocalyptic, but it would still be pretty bad.</p>

